                    <birth when="1792-05-24">
                        <placeName> </placeName>
                    </birth>
                    <death when="1862-08-27"/>
                    <occupation>biographer of Percy Bysshe Shelley</occupation>
                    <occupation>lawyer</occupation>
                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p>Hogg attended Oxford with <persName key="SHE01">Percy Shelley</persName> and was expelled with him for writing <title>The Necessity of Atheism</title>. He had a long, 
    if strained relationship with Shelley and his circle and was asked by the Shelley family to write a biography of the poet. </p>
                    </note>
